tmux-config
===========

My tmux configuration.


Installation
------------

tmux 3.1+ reads $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tmux/tmux.conf when starting a server. Clone
the repository to the standard location:

    git clone git@github.com:<user>/tmux-config.git ~/.config/tmux

To load the configuration into a running tmux server, run this command from
either a tmux pane or a shell outside tmux:

    tmux source-file ~/.config/tmux/tmux.conf

After it is loaded, press C-Space, then r to reload it from within tmux.


Cheatsheet
----------

See CHEATSHEET for session, window, pane, and copy-mode commands.

